§§ `Other insurance (Part 4 clause 6)`
-- Benefit 2, the surgeon, 10m; another insurer pays 3m; all the limits come to 120m, PTI's
-- for benefit 2 being 60m. Excess: min(10m, 7m) = 7m; ratio: 10m x 60/120 = 5m; 7m.
`a claim with other insurance` MEANS
    `The claim` WITH
        `the insured person`                    IS `the insured person`
        `the policy`                            IS `the standard policy`
        `the event`                             IS `the standard illness event`
        `the items`                             IS EMPTY
        `the filing`                            IS `a filing in time`
        `other insurance`                       IS JUST (`Other insurance` WITH `the amount the other insurance pays` IS 3_000_000, `the limits of all the insurances, in total` IS 120_000_000)
        `already counted earlier in the period` IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the outcome of the line` (`a line under` `Programme II benefit 2: surgery for illness` `for` `the surgeon` `on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `of` 10_000_000) `in` `a claim with other insurance` EQUALS `payable` 7_000_000

§§ `Several layers at once`
-- Admitted 1 May 2026, discharged 4 May (four days), first-year policy; 45m already counted
-- against benefit 1 and against Programme II earlier in the period. Lines, in order:
--   costs before admission, examination on 25 April, 600k            -> 600k
--   benefit 1, the bed, charged 6m, 5m reasonable; 1m a day x 4 = 4m -> 4m (5m left of 50m)
--   benefit 1, medicines, 3m                                          -> 1m (1m left of 50m)
--   income allowance, 4 days x 300k                                  -> 1.2m
-- Total 6.8m.
`the May lines` MEANS
    LIST (`an outside line under` `Programme II other benefit: costs before admission` `for` `examination` `on` (YMD 2026 4 25) `of` 600_000 `at` `a hospital in Vietnam` `, ordered by` `the doctor's order`)
       , (`a line under` `Programme II benefit 1: hospitalisation for illness` `for` `the bed` `on` (YMD 2026 5 1) `charged` 6_000_000 `, reasonable` 5_000_000)
       , (`a line under` `Programme II benefit 1: hospitalisation for illness` `for` `(I) medicines used during the hospital stay` `on` (YMD 2026 5 1) `of` 3_000_000)
       , (`a fixed-sum line under` `optional benefit 5: income allowance` `on` (YMD 2026 5 1))

`the May counts` MEANS
    LIST (`An amount counted against a limit` WITH `the limit` IS `the limit for` `Programme II benefit 1: hospitalisation for illness`, `the amount` IS 45_000_000)
       , (`An amount counted against a limit` WITH `the limit` IS `the main limit of` `Programme II`, `the amount` IS 45_000_000)

GIVEN n IS A DATE
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The filing of the claim`
`a filing notified on` n `and submitted on` d MEANS
    `The filing of the claim` WITH
        `the date PTI was notified`                     IS JUST n
        `the date the claim file was submitted`         IS JUST d
        `the date PTI asked for more documents`         IS NOTHING
        `the date the further documents were submitted` IS NOTHING
        `prevented by force majeure`                    IS FALSE
        `the documents submitted`                       IS EMPTY
        `an invoice gives only a combined total`        IS FALSE

`the May claim` MEANS
    `The claim` WITH
        `the insured person`                    IS `the insured person`
        `the policy`                            IS `the standard policy`
        `the event`                             IS `an illness with a stay from` (YMD 2026 5 1) `to` (YMD 2026 5 4)
        `the items`                             IS `the May lines`
        `the filing`                            IS `a filing notified on` (YMD 2026 5 10) `and submitted on` (YMD 2026 5 20)
        `other insurance`                       IS NOTHING
        `already counted earlier in the period` IS `the May counts`

