GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `The claim`
`the standard claim, filed on` d MEANS
    `The claim` WITH
        `the insured person`                    IS `the insured person`
        `the policy`                            IS `the standard policy`
        `the event`                             IS `the standard illness event`
        `the items`                             IS LIST `a clean benefit 1 line`
        `the filing`                            IS `a filing notified on` (YMD 2026 3 10) `and submitted on` d
        `other insurance`                       IS NOTHING
        `already counted earlier in the period` IS EMPTY

#ASSERT `the outcome for the claim` (`the standard claim, filed on` (YMD 2026 8 30)) EQUALS `assessed` (LIST (`payable` 2_000_000)) 2_000_000
#ASSERT `the outcome for the claim` (`the standard claim, filed on` (YMD 2026 8 31)) EQUALS `refused in full, the claim being filed late`
